#compdef netman sshman pathman aliaman aliasman installman updateman configman gitman fileman helpman manman moduleman miscman searchman cyberman cyberlearn devman virtman displayman diffman diskman doctorman processman routeman multimediaman shellman anonyman anonymman dockerman testman testzshman dfm dfmenu
# Complétion unifiée des *man — share/completions/mans.conf

local df="${DOTFILES_DIR:-$HOME/dotfiles}"
local conf="$df/share/completions/mans.conf"
local cmd="${words[1]:-}"
local -a meta subs common dig_extra mans menus
meta=(help -h --help menu --interactive)

[[ -n "$cmd" ]] || return 0

if [[ -f "$conf" ]]; then
  local line
  line=$(grep -E "^${cmd}:" "$conf" 2>/dev/null | head -1 | cut -d: -f2-)
  subs=(${=line})
fi

_dotfiles_mans_add() {
  (( $# == 0 )) && return 0
  if (( $+functions[compadd] )); then
    compadd -U -- "$@"
  else
    autoload -Uz compadd 2>/dev/null
    (( $+functions[compadd] )) && compadd -U -- "$@"
  fi
}

# helpman <manager> [sous-cmd]
if [[ "$cmd" == helpman ]]; then
  if (( CURRENT == 2 )); then
    [[ -d "$df/core/managers" ]] && mans=("$df"/core/managers/*(/N:t))
    _dotfiles_mans_add "$meta[@]" "$mans[@]"
    return 0
  fi
  if (( CURRENT >= 3 )) && [[ -f "$conf" ]]; then
    line=$(grep -E "^${words[2]}:" "$conf" 2>/dev/null | head -1 | cut -d: -f2-)
    subs=(${=line})
    _dotfiles_mans_add "$meta[@]" "$subs[@]"
    return 0
  fi
fi

# dfm / dfmenu
if [[ "$cmd" == dfm || "$cmd" == dfmenu ]]; then
  if (( CURRENT == 2 )); then
    local d="$df/share/menus"
    [[ -d "$d" ]] && menus=("$d"/*.menu(N:t:r))
    _dotfiles_mans_add "$menus[@]"
    return 0
  fi
fi

if (( CURRENT == 2 )); then
  common=("$meta[@]" "$subs[@]")
  _dotfiles_mans_add "$common[@]"
  return 0
fi

if [[ "$cmd" == netman && "${words[2]:-}" == dig ]]; then
  dig_extra=(help -h A AAAA MX NS TXT SOA CNAME ANY +trace -x --raw @1.1.1.1 @8.8.8.8)
  _dotfiles_mans_add "$dig_extra[@]"
  return 0
fi

return 0
